    `I am a woman` IS TRUE
    `the searching officer is a woman` IS FALSE
    `I asked to be present when my baggage is searched` IS FALSE
    `I presented myself within a reasonable time` IS FALSE
    `I am present` IS FALSE

`a traveller who asked to watch the baggage search and came back in time, now absent` MEANS `My search` WITH
